<law>
	<structure>
		<unit label="title" identifier="15.2" level="1">Counties, Cities and Towns</unit>
		<unit label="subtitle" identifier="II" level="2">Powers of Local Government</unit>
		<unit label="chapter" identifier="25" level="3">Budgets, Audits and Reports</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>15.2-2513</section_number>
	<catch_line>Special budget provisions</catch_line>
	<text>
		Every locality having special budget provisions in general or special law may choose, by resolution, to comply with the budget provisions of this chapter rather than those special budget provisions.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, §§ 15-584, 15-585; 1959, Ex. Sess., c. 69; 1962, c. 623, §§ 15.1-168, 15.1-169; 1997, c. 587.</history>
</law>
